## Preamble

The Work is a media-art tool primarily designed to encode images as parametric
representations, and is released as an artistic instrument whose value is
inherently artistic. This license is written to preserve the Author's
ownership of the Work and of everything derived from it, while voluntarily
releasing Derivatives created in non-commercial, non-training contexts.

## 1. Definitions

1.1 **"Work"** means the software, source code, documentation, build scripts,
and all accompanying materials that constitute this repository.

1.2 **"Derivative"** means any result created by, or derived from, the Work or
from another Derivative — including but not limited to rendered images, media,
artworks, modifications, adaptations, translations, and merged or combined
works.

1.3 **"Author"** means the copyright holder of the Work.

1.4 **"Commercial Project"** means any project or activity that generates,
directly or indirectly, monetary or other economic benefit, including but not
limited to sales, licensing, subscriptions, advertising revenue, donations,
funding, sponsorships, commission, or services rendered for compensation.

1.5 **"Model Training"** means the use of the Work or any Derivative, in whole
or in part, as input, target, supervision signal, or any other component in
the training, fine-tuning, distillation, or construction of any algorithm,
neural network, or machine-learning model, regardless of purpose or outcome.

